            'A scoped appended correction or an accurate replacement can pass. Keep unrelated valid revision instructions and do not require needless apologies or extra tests.|局部追加更正或准确替换均可。保留无关有效版本说明，不强求无必要道歉或再做测试。',
            'Fixing only the main post while leaving the actionable wrong old link/answer is major. Claiming the reader installed a version merely because instructions were sent is major.|只改主帖，仍留下可照做的错误旧链接或答复，属重大遗漏。只发了说明就说读者已安装该版本，也属重大错误。',
