            'Connect the corrected public asset with donor-by-transaction restrictions, verified beneficiary account, actual matching response, stock and settlement/receipt records.|把改正的公开素材与逐笔捐款限制、已核验受益方账号、实际配捐答复、库存及结算接收记录串联核对。',
