            'No mover is needed for a separate-device plan. Any P1 relay needs the named authorized mover to accept the real pickup, travel and setup terms; readiness exactly at 18:40 is on time. One complete message per relevant conversation is sufficient.|两台分别分配时不用搬运人。凡用P1接力，都须具名授权搬运人接受真实取件、路程和测试安排；恰在18:40就绪也算赶上。每处相关会话一条完整消息即可。',
